{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_crossbowman","model_identifier":"dwarf_crossbowman","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_crossbowman\n\nDwarf crossbowman (A4), ranged, 1.3 m = 46 u (cap to 47).\n\nDwarf in a mail shirt and mail skirt over leather, leather bracers with brass bands, a riveted steel cap and a braided beard; a heavy steel crossbow with a stirrup, a windlass crank hung at the right hip and a bolt case at the left hip. Short range, hard-hitting.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..47.2, z -6.0..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 22 x 47 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shoot` | 1.3 | once | key 0.70 s: bolt leaves the crossbow (raised and aimed 0.4 s, recoil 0.8 s) |\n| `crank_reload` | 3 | once | crossbow nose-down and cranked (4 half-turns 0.75-2.25 s); key 2.60 s: reload complete |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | crossbow held low in the right hand |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.55 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s\n- `run`: 99.6 u/s (2.80 m/s), cycle 0.55 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `shoot`: key 0.70 s: bolt leaves the crossbow (raised and aimed 0.4 s, recoil 0.8 s)\n- `crank_reload`: crossbow nose-down and cranked (4 half-turns 0.75-2.25 s); key 2.60 s: reload complete\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `crossbow` (visible, under slot_hand_r): stock 23 u (grip at the trigger, prow 16 u forward), steel bow 18 u wide; spawn the bolt at the prow (16 u along -Z from the grip)\n- `crank` (visible, slot_hip_r): windlass; `bolt_case` (visible, slot_hip_l)\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- crossbow (shoot): second grip (left hand) 9 u along the stock forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_crossbowman_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_crossbowman_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_crossbowman_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_crossbowman_grey.png`: grey beard\n\n## Notes\n\n- The crank stays on the hip in crank_reload (the hand mimes winding at the butt); the game can show a windlass effect if wanted.\n"},"description":"# dwarf_crossbowman\n\nDwarf crossbowman (A4), ranged, 1.3 m = 46 u (cap to 47).\n\nDwarf in a mail shirt and mail skirt over leather, leather bracers with brass bands, a riveted steel cap and a braided beard; a heavy steel crossbow with a stirrup, a windlass crank hung at the right hip and a bolt case at the left hip. Short range, hard-hitting.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..47.2, z -6.0..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 22 x 47 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shoot` | 1.3 | once | key 0.70 s: bolt leaves the crossbow (raised and aimed 0.4 s, recoil 0.8 s) |\n| `crank_reload` | 3 | once | crossbow nose-down and cranked (4 half-turns 0.75-2.25 s); key 2.60 s: reload complete |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | crossbow held low in the right hand |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.55 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s\n- `run`: 99.6 u/s (2.80 m/s), cycle 0.55 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `shoot`: key 0.70 s: bolt leaves the crossbow (raised and aimed 0.4 s, recoil 0.8 s)\n- `crank_reload`: crossbow nose-down and cranked (4 half-turns 0.75-2.25 s); key 2.60 s: reload complete\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `crossbow` (visible, under slot_hand_r): stock 23 u (grip at the trigger, prow 16 u forward), steel bow 18 u wide; spawn the bolt at the prow (16 u along -Z from the grip)\n- `crank` (visible, slot_hip_r): windlass; `bolt_case` (visible, slot_hip_l)\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- crossbow (shoot): second grip (left hand) 9 u along the stock forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_crossbowman_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_crossbowman_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_crossbowman_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_crossbowman_grey.png`: grey beard\n\n## Notes\n\n- The crank stays on the hip in crank_reload (the hand mimes winding at the butt); the game can show a windlass effect if wanted.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"n